      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "地牢金币既能即时换取生存资源，也可冒险保留并上缴皇帝，形成持续取舍。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Spend the gold you find to help you survive - or risk saving it for the Emperor.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1883920/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "推进地牢时会接受围绕心理状态及与棋子关系的测试。",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Answer simple questions based on your psychological state and relationships to your pieces as you progress through the depths of the Dungeon.",
